      "line": 35,
      "signature": "theorem Qform_range_eq_eisNorm (t : ℤ) : Set.range (fun p : ℤ × ℤ => Qform t p.1 p.2) = Set.range (fun p : ℤ × ℤ => eisNorm p.1 p.2)",
